  "input": "What is the notifier's dependency?\n[2025-02-13] standup/boreal/2025-02-13: The notifier calls the event-bus for delivery events, so treat the event-bus as a hard dependency of the notifier. Dependency map update: webhooks needs the event-bus (outbound events). [2026-03-17] standup/cinder/2026-03-17: Reminder: notifier is owned by team Cinder. [2025-01-09] standup/boreal/2025-01-09: The event bus is a the Boreal team service. The Boreal team owns notifier.",
